(7133734, 1093117, 19944, '<td valign="top">For someone who is just looking at the photo quickly, they may not realize that it is multiple exposures.  Everyone just blends together.  I''m not sure if that''s a good thing or a bad thing.</td>', 'For someone who is just looking at the photo quickly, they may not realize that it is multiple exposures.  Everyone just blends together.  I''m not sure if that''s a good thing or a bad thing.', '2013-11-22 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133735, 1093086, 19944, '<td valign="top">I''m usually not a fan of sepia toning, but it actually works here.  I think because there is decent contrast.</td>', 'I''m usually not a fan of sepia toning, but it actually works here.  I think because there is decent contrast.', '2013-11-22 16:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7133736, 1092594, 19944, '<td valign="top">Without knowing that I was looking at photos that were multiple images, I''d never know it.  In this case, there is nothing to make me look at it and say, "Oh, hey!  That''s multiple images.  Cool!"  It''s not a bad photo, I just don''t see how it fits the intent of the challenge.</td>', 'Without knowing that I was looking at photos that were multiple images, I''d never know it.  In this case, there is nothing to make me look at it and say, "Oh, hey!  That''s multiple images.  Cool!"  It''s not a bad photo, I just don''t see how it fits the intent of the challenge.', '2013-11-22 16:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
