(7134382, 1093074, 10785, '<td valign="top">My understanding of this challenge was to go out to a spot and park your camera, then observe the area to find the hidden rhythms of the people walking by. Finally, through photoshop, use your images to reveal the rhythms you observed. I think this image exemplifies the challenge by you observing the area and revealing the rhtyhm of the people passing by in your final photo!</td>', 'My understanding of this challenge was to go out to a spot and park your camera, then observe the area to find the hidden rhythms of the people walking by. Finally, through photoshop, use your images to reveal the rhythms you observed. I think this image exemplifies the challenge by you observing the area and revealing the rhtyhm of the people passing by in your final photo!', '2013-11-24 20:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
