(7135229, 1093094, 100773, '<td valign="top">The black and white looks a little grey to me, so I would''ve punched it up with a little more contrast. A curves layer in soft light maybe, and reduced it''s opacity to my liking. 6</td>', 'The black and white looks a little grey to me, so I would''ve punched it up with a little more contrast. A curves layer in soft light maybe, and reduced it''s opacity to my liking. 6', '2013-11-26 16:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7135239, 1093075, 100773, '<td valign="top">The three kids in the back looks like they have been retouched in later, which is kinda the point with this challenge, but it shouldn''t look like it. It looks like the one on the right has a halo around its head, and the one on the left has a messed up dark area around it. It might be the shadow, but it looks like photoshop. Apart from that this shot is absolutely amazing! 7</td>', 'The three kids in the back looks like they have been retouched in later, which is kinda the point with this challenge, but it shouldn''t look like it. It looks like the one on the right has a halo around its head, and the one on the left has a messed up dark area around it. It might be the shadow, but it looks like photoshop. Apart from that this shot is absolutely amazing! 7', '2013-11-26 16:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7135251, 1092620, 100773, '<td valign="top">The concept and idea here is very funny, and I''m a huge f1 fan so you get extra points for that! The photographic performance is a bit boring tho, but I guess you had other things to do than to take pictures. Cool that you managed to get a lock up, and I''m guessing that''s the reason you went for the force india rather than ferrari for instance? Hope the experience was good :) 7</td>', 'The concept and idea here is very funny, and I''m a huge f1 fan so you get extra points for that! The photographic performance is a bit boring tho, but I guess you had other things to do than to take pictures. Cool that you managed to get a lock up, and I''m guessing that''s the reason you went for the force india rather than ferrari for instance? Hope the experience was good :) 7', '2013-11-26 16:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7135252, 1093087, 100773, '<td valign="top">Why the match? You should''ve kept the shadows under your feet. As it is now it doesn''t physically look you''re in the bathroom. Fun shot tho, but the lack of shadows makes this a 4 from me</td>', 'Why the match? You should''ve kept the shadows under your feet. As it is now it doesn''t physically look you''re in the bathroom. Fun shot tho, but the lack of shadows makes this a 4 from me', '2013-11-26 16:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7135256, 1092607, 100773, '<td valign="top">There are a few things here that points to that you haven''t had the camera in the exact same spot, but I won''t punish you for that. The picture is gorgeous, and there''s just a few personal references that makes this an 8 for me.</td>', 'There are a few things here that points to that you haven''t had the camera in the exact same spot, but I won''t punish you for that. The picture is gorgeous, and there''s just a few personal references that makes this an 8 for me.', '2013-11-26 16:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7135264, 1093056, 100773, '<td valign="top">I would''ve made a vignette of some sort around the lit woman in front there, and make this photograph about her, because she is very interesting. That or included the girl with the pink jacket and the girl with the yellow jacket in more places because I just get the feeling that this is a busy afternoon rather than a photograph with multiple exposures. But it''s a nice picture tho. 6</td>', 'I would''ve made a vignette of some sort around the lit woman in front there, and make this photograph about her, because she is very interesting. That or included the girl with the pink jacket and the girl with the yellow jacket in more places because I just get the feeling that this is a busy afternoon rather than a photograph with multiple exposures. But it''s a nice picture tho. 6', '2013-11-26 16:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
