(7136219, 1093087, 135744, '<td valign="top">Wow well done Katie. I thought this would ribbon but it was pretty damn close. Super photo. Go Shady Sheep!</td>', 'Wow well done Katie. I thought this would ribbon but it was pretty damn close. Super photo. Go Shady Sheep!', '2013-11-29 02:38:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7136220, 1093110, 45631, '<td valign="top">Great image for the challenge.  Welcome back.  Will we be seeing more of you?<br/>I always remember that  you introduced me to this site.  In case I never did ''thanks''   :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-11-29 02:47:34.</i></td>', 'Great image for the challenge.  Welcome back.  Will we be seeing more of you?I always remember that  you introduced me to this site.  In case I never did ''thanks''   :)', '2013-11-29 02:46:36.000000', '2013-11-29 02:47:34.000000', 0),
(7136221, 1093077, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Christophe! Lovely work as always. You have such a gift for putting elements together and the soft, dreamy light is perfect for this fantasy.</td>', 'Congratulations Christophe! Lovely work as always. You have such a gift for putting elements together and the soft, dreamy light is perfect for this fantasy.', '2013-11-29 02:57:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7136222, 1093114, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Samantha. What a cool creation. I particularly love the cat investigating the wall.</td>', 'Congratulations Samantha. What a cool creation. I particularly love the cat investigating the wall.', '2013-11-29 03:00:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7136226, 1093087, 118154, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Katie.</td>', 'Congratulations Katie.', '2013-11-29 03:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7136228, 1093075, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh, Clive.  A ribbon!  How can I remain true to you now, you shameless tart?<br/> <br/>I hope you will tolerate my saying that it is to my recollection your least interesting photograph (which is not to say it''s uninteresting, because it''s not ... but its lesser-celebrated stablemates in your portfolio set a fiercely high standard interest-wise).  I blame the challenge topic, which near enough forced the entrants into playing the same hackneyed old ''multiple appearance'' game.  You at least played it with some rare sense of lightness of touch, and my congrats for that.  But please don''t make a habit of this ribbon stuff, mate.</td>', 'Oh, Clive.  A ribbon!  How can I remain true to you now, you shameless tart? I hope you will tolerate my saying that it is to my recollection your least interesting photograph (which is not to say it''s uninteresting, because it''s not ... but its lesser-celebrated stablemates in your portfolio set a fiercely high standard interest-wise).  I blame the challenge topic, which near enough forced the entrants into playing the same hackneyed old ''multiple appearance'' game.  You at least played it with some rare sense of lightness of touch, and my congrats for that.  But please don''t make a habit of this ribbon stuff, mate.', '2013-11-29 03:45:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7136230, 1093087, 147314, '<td valign="top">This is so funny, congrats on the HM (should have ribonned IMHO)!</td>', 'This is so funny, congrats on the HM (should have ribonned IMHO)!', '2013-11-29 04:16:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7136231, 1093094, 147314, '<td valign="top">It''s like watching The Matrix in B&amp;W (with those twins walking around). Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'It''s like watching The Matrix in B&W (with those twins walking around). Nice take on the challenge.', '2013-11-29 04:18:45.000000', NULL, 0),
