(7136360, 1093075, 117534, '<td valign="top">Reminder to self.... Take lesson from Clive, leave shadows in the shot...<br/> <br/>Actually pokeing fun at ME... Very Nicely done, The thing I like most is it don''t look "Expert Edited" Which I think is Stunning!!!  Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon!!!</td>', 'Reminder to self.... Take lesson from Clive, leave shadows in the shot... Actually pokeing fun at ME... Very Nicely done, The thing I like most is it don''t look "Expert Edited" Which I think is Stunning!!!  Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon!!!', '2013-11-29 14:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7136361, 1093096, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Venser:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Alexkc:</b></div><hr/><i>It seems like it''s been a waste of time.</i></td></tr></table>Do you like the image? <br/> <br/>If yes, then it wasn''t a waste of time.<br/>If no, you''re on your own. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Of course not a waste of time, I wrote it when I was full of rant (and I shouldn''t but this is life). But i don''t like to delete my first comment, even if it''s silly - I take the risk.</td>', 'Originally posted by Venser: Originally posted by Alexkc:It seems like it''s been a waste of time.Do you like the image?  If yes, then it wasn''t a waste of time.If no, you''re on your own.   Of course not a waste of time, I wrote it when I was full of rant (and I shouldn''t but this is life). But i don''t like to delete my first comment, even if it''s silly - I take the risk.', '2013-11-29 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7136366, 1093075, 65319, '<td valign="top">Clive, your talent is so flexible!!!  You ribbon alongside the best of them, but still you are loved by the worst of us. You remain my favorite poet.  Cheers!</td>', 'Clive, your talent is so flexible!!!  You ribbon alongside the best of them, but still you are loved by the worst of us. You remain my favorite poet.  Cheers!', '2013-11-29 15:34:58.000000', NULL, 0),
